  m_Text: "<size=46><color=#1F5A66>Desenvolvimento</color></size>\r\nMaria Eduarda de Jezus Guimar\xE3es\r\n\r\n<size=46><color=#1F5A66>Projeto</color></size>\r\nProjeto Glotec, Universidade de Bras\xEDlia\r\n\r\n<size=46><color=#1F5A66>Defini\xE7\xF5es e ilustra\xE7\xF5es</color></size>\r\nDefini\xE7\xF5es e ilustra\xE7\xF5es: gloss\xE1rio Glotr\xE2nsito (glotransito.com)\r\n\r\n<size=46><color=#1F5A66>Arte, sons e fontes</color></size>\r\n\r\n<size=38><color=#C8781E>CC0 (dom\xEDnio p\xFAblico)</color></size>\r\nCity Kit Roads (1.1)<color=#5A6570> \u2014 Kenney</color>\r\nCity Kit Suburban (1.0)<color=#5A6570> \u2014 Kenney</color>\r\nCar Kit (2.0)<color=#5A6570> \u2014 Kenney</color>\r\nFood Kit (2.0)<color=#5A6570> \u2014 Kenney</color>\r\nUltimate Nature Pack<color=#5A6570> \u2014 Quaternius</color>\r\nDowntown City MegaKit (Standard)<color=#5A6570> \u2014 Quaternius</color>\r\nUltimate Animated Character Pack (nov/2019)<color=#5A6570> \u2014 Quaternius</color>\r\nMini Characters<color=#5A6570> \u2014 Kenney</color>\r\nUltimate Animated Animals (jul/2021)<color=#5A6570> \u2014 Quaternius</color>\r\nFarm Animals<color=#5A6570> \u2014 Quaternius</color>\r\nPublic Transport Pack (fev/2017)<color=#5A6570> \u2014 Quaternius</color>\r\nCity Builder Bits (1.0)<color=#5A6570> \u2014 Kay Lousberg</color>\r\nCity Kit Commercial (2.1)<color=#5A6570> \u2014 Kenney</color>\r\nFurniture Kit<color=#5A6570> \u2014 Kenney</color>\r\nUI Pack<color=#5A6570> \u2014 Kenney</color>\r\nInterface Sounds<color=#5A6570> \u2014 Kenney</color>\r\nImpact Sounds<color=#5A6570> \u2014 Kenney</color>\r\nTraffic Road Assets (2022)<color=#5A6570> \u2014 MilkAndBanana</color>\r\nModelos avulsos do poly.pizza<color=#5A6570> \u2014 Quaternius</color>\r\n\r\n<size=38><color=#C8781E>CC BY 4.0 (cr\xE9dito obrigat\xF3rio)</color></size>\r\n\"Cathedral Of Bras\xEDlia\" (https://sketchfab.com/3d-models/cathedral-of-brasilia-9f2d2de9642f48ac873b5aab62b667f7)<color=#5A6570> \u2014 cuankiproduction</color>\r\n\"Pal\xE1cio do Planalto - Oscar Niemeyer\" (https://sketchfab.com/3d-models/palacio-do-planalto-oscar-niemeyer-1240d2a091c84ea0bc4c96ad9be6eb4b)<color=#5A6570> \u2014 vanrosaa</color>\r\n\"Bras\xEDlia\" (https://sketchfab.com/3d-models/brasilia-b08199e095bc4db0b40d931a3d824d64)<color=#5A6570> \u2014 mapart3d</color>\r\n\"BRAZILIAN BUS STOP\" (https://sketchfab.com/3d-models/brazilian-bus-stop-a66713c8c5a249059d8dac20465ed0fd)<color=#5A6570> \u2014 ijiklvn</color>\r\n\"Trash can - Low poly (Free)\" (https://sketchfab.com/3d-models/trash-can-low-poly-free-1db9609bfb80446e9b9a2c632309daeb)<color=#5A6570> \u2014 davidnegligence</color>\r\n\r\n<size=38><color=#C8781E>Licen\xE7a a confirmar</color></size>\r\nCityEnvPack1\r\nCity Pack\r\nPasta \"lixos\"\r\nDestroyed City Assets\r\npuddle_ground-1K\r\n\r\n<size=38><color=#C8781E>CC BY 3.0 (cr\xE9dito obrigat\xF3rio)</color></size>\r\nBroom e Rubbish<color=#5A6570> \u2014 Poly by Google</color>\r\n\r\n<size=38><color=#C8781E>Origem e licen\xE7a a confirmar</color></size>\r\nUnity 6 Cartoon City Free (v1.0)<color=#5A6570> \u2014 ithappy</color>\r\ncar-dash (dash.zip)<color=#5A6570> \u2014 n\xE3o identificado</color>\r\nsteering-wheel-shutt-s3rr<color=#5A6570> \u2014 n\xE3o identificado</color>\r\nCar Radio - with tape player<color=#5A6570> \u2014 Jakers_H</color>\r\nclip-belt (CLIP BELT 2.fbx)<color=#5A6570> \u2014 n\xE3o identificado</color>\r\n\r\n<size=38><color=#C8781E>SIL Open Font License 1.1</color></size>\r\nBaloo 2<color=#5A6570> \u2014 The Baloo 2 Project Authors</color>\r\nLilita One<color=#5A6570> \u2014 Juan Montoreano</color>\r\n\r\n<size=46><color=#1F5A66>Feito pela equipe</color></size>\r\nPlacas, sem\xE1foros, pe\xE7as da oficina, estruturas das obras, bancos e cabine do carro, capacete, \xEDcones e os sons sintetizados: feitos pela equipe com formas simples."
